      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want to \"build a foundation.\" i don't want a steady, ordinary life. i've spent every waking hour training for greatness, and now that i know it's not happening, everything else just feels like a consolation prize. it feels like being forced to live a life that i never even signed up for. it's just empty.",
